{title: Greatly To Be Praised}
{subtitle: Psalms 48:2}
{key: Dm}
{tempo: 73}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] | [Dm] | [Bb] | [F] |
| [C] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]Great is the [Am]Lord in His [Bb]holy place
Greatly to be [F]praised in [A]this holy [Dm]space
In the c[Am7/C]ity of [Bb]our God He reigns
His [F]holy mountain bears [C]the [Dm]weight of praise
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
Beautiful in its heights [Am]to all [Bb]the earth
Mount Zion rises with a [F]sa[Am]cred worth
[Dm]On the far [Am7/C]northern slopes the [Bb]King resides
[Gm7]In the city [Am]where His glory a[F]bides
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
God is within [C]her citadels strong
He [Dm]has shown himself [Bb]the fortress song
He is [F]the shield and the safe [C]retreat
Where [Bb]the kings of the [C]earth meet in [Dm]de[Am/C]feat [Bb]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Dm]Look how the kings have as[Am]sembled here
[Bb]They advanced together in their [F]fear
[Am]But the [Dm]great King [Am/C]holds the city [Bb]fast
His [Gm7]fortress stands a[Am]gainst all that [F]lasts
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
God is within her [C]citadels strong
He has [Dm]shown himself the [Bb]fortress song
He is the [F]shield and the safe re[C]treat
Where the [Bb]kings of the earth [C]meet in de[Dm]feat
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Bb]Joy of all the earth this mountain [F]brings
The [C]city of the great King in its [Dm]wings
Greatly [Bb]praised in the holy [Dm]ground
Where the Lord [Bb]has made His [C]fortress [F]found
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Dm]Great is the Lord in the [C]city of God
His [Bb]holy mountain is the joy of all ab[Dm][Am/C][Bb]road [F]
{end_of_verse}
